{"parse":{"title":"装备图鉴库/星陨焚空","pageid":5992,"revid":14449,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%98%9F%E9%99%A8%E7%84%9A%E7%A9%BA&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%98%9F%E9%99%A8%E7%84%9A%E7%A9%BA&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%98%9F%E9%99%A8%E7%84%9A%E7%A9%BA&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"装备图鉴库\">装备图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>星陨焚空</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n<span id=\"PNN\" style=\"display: none\">sword_sr</span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"BILIBILI-BOX BOX-4-tr\" style=\"background: rgb(240 236 226 / 70%)\"><div class=\"BOX-2-1\" style=\"\"><div class=\"BOX-title-1\">星陨焚空</div>\n<div class=\"BOX-N\" style=\"\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap: wrap\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 pull-right\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; background:none\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2;\" width=\"35%\"><center><img alt=\"装备全图 星陨焚空.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/13/mxdbklotl9k77qepmigykzuhus35dv6.png/150px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BE_%E6%98%9F%E9%99%A8%E7%84%9A%E7%A9%BA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"ht